  <item>
    <title>毕业即失业？F1学院本质是一场“变形记”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a855a06ef65145dfcc1f225</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a855a06ef65145dfcc1f225</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 07:40:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上周因为在参加德比斯中国行导致这周才做这个节目，但我希望对这个问题的讨论还不算晚！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> maya weug的ins原文</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 介绍maya，她的低级别履历</span></p><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a>加入法拉利青训</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a>从FRECA到F1学院，如何评价这种级别的倒退？</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">09:48</a> F1学院的出现是为了解决三个阶段性问题</span></p><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 职业化培养和人才池（包括 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a>运动员的系统培养 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a>求助的通畅渠道）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 比赛机会和曝光（曝光增加了，但<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a>比赛里程减少了）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 资金和晋升</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>（已经毕业的人后来怎么样了？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 23冠军marta garcia，<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a>abbi pulling <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a>Bianca <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> alba <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a>al qubaisi姐妹 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> doriane pin，<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a>评估maya weug为什么没席位）</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a>我的观点</span></p><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> </span><strong><span>maya遇见的问题，看似是个体问题，实际上是“时代车手”的困境</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a></span><strong><span> 把maya2026年没有席位归结为性别的问题，这个结论是可以完善的</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> </span><strong><span>F1学院打造了一个象牙塔，是一场变形记</span></strong></p></blockquote><p></p>]]></description>
