    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不知道大家会不会对这种题材感兴趣但还是做了这期，来看看讲了些啥↓</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a></span></strong><span> 预算帽非F1首创</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span></strong><span> 被FIA画饼坑惨：三支新车队的破产史</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></strong><span> 小车队亏钱，大车队狂烧3个亿</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">08:21</a></span></strong><span> 痛失3000万奖金，马诺车队破产</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a></span></strong><span> F1收入暴跌，大车队终于低头</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a></span></strong><span> 规则拆解</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">15:18</a></span></strong><span> 红牛违规受罚</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1038">17:18</a></span></strong><span> 2026规则</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a></span></strong><span> 效果评估</span><br><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a></span></strong><span> 灰色地带：梅奔造游艇</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一周都在查预算帽的资料，20页的word最后讲出来竟然只有23分钟，我觉得好神奇.....</span></p>]]></description>
