  <item>
    <title>从Susie Wolff的自传讲起，聊聊女车手、赛车女郎、WAGs和女车迷 | 妇女节特辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a83f9ce46749707ffbe111</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a83f9ce46749707ffbe111</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>妇女节快乐！当我迈向30岁，我终于也开始拥抱这个被美化成“女生节”“女神节”的节日了，并在酝酿了半年之久后，有了今天这期播客，看看我们聊了些啥↓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a> susie成长经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a>关于“最佳女车手”的复杂感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a>“这是一种象征性的努力，一种面子工程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a>关于制度、身体规范与男性默认路径的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a>体育如何成为生产与再生产男性气质的机器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a>“到底是制度先设计成这样，还是因为女性少所以不被考虑？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">45:54</a>形象、赞助与妥协</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3607">1:00:07</a>性骚扰与权力结构下的沉默</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3788">1:03:08</a>当女性在赛车文化中持续面对‘玩笑’与排斥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3909">1:05:09</a>与 Toto 关系的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4120">1:08:40</a>在 DTM 用成绩换取尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">1:15:00</a>女性在男性主导文化中的长期处境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4830">1:20:30</a>进入体系本身就是一种行动，但不等于规则被重写</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5280">1:28:00</a>数量的增多不等于制度被改变：可见性与结构性问题之间的落差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5700">1:35:00</a>从参与者转向决策层的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6120">1:42:00</a>关于女性气质、化妆、‘假小子’与自我选择</span></p>]]></description>
