  <item>
    <title>专访：怎样的天时地利人和，才能培养出来“CKC女王”于昊希？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698b18b666e2c30377d60ca8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698b18b666e2c30377d60ca8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 11:49:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>年前最后一次更新啦，今天我请来了于昊希的妈妈，来聊聊这位在国内卡丁车界所向披靡的女车手于昊希~然后祝大家春节快乐，幸福安康♥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> “CKC女王”于昊希是谁？——铁豆眼中的天赋型女车手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 因体弱接触户外运动，意外发掘赛车天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 从娱乐车到专业车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a> 赛场初体验：规则与心态的磨炼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 赛车带来的质变：从不爱说话到阳光自信的“学霸”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 科学训练体系：体能、模拟器、团队配合与时间管理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 女性车手的困境：如何克服恐惧、应对赛场孤单与高压？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 姐弟互动：弟弟如何成为姐姐训练的“工具人”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1286">21:26</a> 路径规划：如何寻找好的教练？信息搜集与决策过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 走向国际：中汽联推荐与参与世界级赛事的机遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a> 进阶方程式：从卡丁车到FR/F4的感受差异与未来目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2309">38:29</a> 深度揭秘：国内与国际卡丁车比赛的真实花费是多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">41:27</a> 现实门槛：除了金钱，家长的“坚持”才是最大的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a> 父母不仅是支持者，也是推动中国卡丁车事业的筑路人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a> 对家长的建议：赛车运动对孩子心理成长与意志磨炼的独特价值</span></p>]]></description>
